1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:03:12,029
Michael: Mira, have you ever felt like we've been here before? Like this thời tiết, these clouds... everything feels strangely familiar.

2
00:03:12,079 --> 00:10:40,148
Mira: The thời tiết in Saigon is always the same, Michael. Sun, rain, sun, rain. Nothing special. But... sometimes I cảm thấy that way too. Especially when the thời tiết changes suddenly like today.

3
00:10:40,198 --> 00:18:08,267
Michael: Exactly! Today's thời tiết is so kỳ lạ. Blazing sun in the morning, pouring rain in the afternoon. But I'm not just talking about the thời tiết. Do you believe in things like deja vu? The feeling that reality isn't what it appears to be?

4
00:18:08,317 --> 00:23:28,366
Mira: I play chess, I'm not a dreamer. Thời tiết is thời tiết, reality is reality. But... sitting next to you in the rain like this, sometimes I do wonder... Never mind. Do you think the rain will stop? I didn't bring an umbrella.

5
00:23:28,416 --> 00:26:40,445
Michael: Who knows? The thời tiết in Saigon is hard to predict. But if it doesn't clear up, we could share my umbrella. Or... you know, stay here longer and keep talking. I like hearing you talk about chess and your thoughts on... reality.

